#~ msgid "层复制（Layer Copy）"
#~ msgstr "Layer Copy"

#~ msgid "功能说明"
#~ msgstr "What the card does"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "对选定原子的 z 坐标施加表达式调制 `dz = f(x, y, z)`，然后将变形后的层按指"
#~ "定层间距和层数沿 z 方向堆叠复制。可选扩胞 z 向盒子和增加真空。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Apply a displacement expression `dz=f(x,y,z)` to selected atoms, then "
#~ "stack copies of the modified layer along z with a specified spacing and "
#~ "layer count. The z cell and extra vacuum can be extended automatically."

#~ msgid "操作示例"
#~ msgstr "Example workflow"

#~ msgid "场景：模型在多层异质结的层间耦合上预测失败"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: The model fails on interlayer coupling"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你在单层 MoS2 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，单层性质很好。然后尝试跑双层 MoS2——层"
#~ "间距离预测偏了 0.5 Å，层间滑移能垒完全不对。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A NEP trained on monolayer MoS2 performs well in plane but misses bilayer "
#~ "spacing by 0.5 Å and predicts the wrong interlayer sliding barrier."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**诊断思路：** 单层 MoS2 里所有原子都是表面原子（双面都有真空），但双层结"
#~ "构中层间区域的 S 原子面对的是另一层 S，局域环境完全不同。训练集里只有单层"
#~ "数据，模型没见过\"上下都有近邻原子\"的层间环境。需要从单层出发，复制出多层"
#~ "堆叠结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Diagnosis:** In a monolayer, both surfaces face vacuum. In a "
#~ "multilayer, interfacial S atoms face another layer and have different "
#~ "local environments. Build stacked structures, then relax and label them "
#~ "to add interlayer chemistry."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫好的单层 MoS2 slab"
#~ msgstr "**Input:** A relaxed monolayer MoS2 slab."

#~ msgid "**目标：** 用 sin 调制给层加起伏，然后复制 3 层，层间距 6.5 Å"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Objective:** Add sinusoidal corrugation and stack three layers at 6.5 Å "
#~ "spacing."

#~ msgid "**参数设置：**"
#~ msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#~ msgid "`Preset Index` = `1`（自定义 dz 表达式）"
#~ msgstr "`Preset Index` = `1` (custom dz expression)"

#~ msgid "`Extend Cell Z` = 勾选"
#~ msgstr "Enable `Extend Cell Z`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出：** 3 层 MoS2，每层原子 z 位置有起伏调制，盒子高度自动扩展，带 "
#~ "`SWC(L=3,dz=6.5)` 标签"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** Three corrugated MoS2 layers in an automatically extended "
#~ "cell, labeled `SWC(L=3,dz=6.5)`."

#~ msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
#~ msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#~ msgid "重训后计算双层 MoS2 的层间距和层间滑移能垒，应接近 DFT 参考"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "After DFT labeling and retraining, compare equilibrium layer spacing and "
#~ "sliding barriers with DFT."

#~ msgid "检查层间是否重叠：最低层的顶部原子和上一层的底部原子距离应 > 2.5 Å"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Check interlayer nearest distances for overlap; use the material-specific "
#~ "physical range."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果模型只对平整层好而对起伏层差，增大 `dz_expr` 的振幅或者换更复杂的位移"
#~ "函数"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If flat layers pass but corrugated layers fail, broaden the physically "
#~ "relevant expression amplitude or shape."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果需要构建多层异质结（如 MoS2/WS2），先用两张独立的 Layer Copy 卡分别处"
#~ "理，再拼接"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "For a heterostructure such as MoS2/WS2, prepare the distinct layer "
#~ "families separately before assembling them."

#~ msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
#~ msgstr "When to add this card"

#~ msgid "**加：**"
#~ msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#~ msgid "研究二维材料、层状材料（MoS2、石墨、BN）的多层性质"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Multilayer properties of two-dimensional or layered materials are in scope"

#~ msgid "需要从单层/少层出发构造多层堆叠"
#~ msgstr "A multilayer stack must be built from one or a few layers"

#~ msgid "需要给平整层加波纹、起伏等层间调制"
#~ msgstr "Corrugation or another controlled out-of-plane modulation is needed"

#~ msgid "**不加：**"
#~ msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#~ msgid "体系不是层状结构（体相晶体、分子团簇）"
#~ msgstr "The structure is not meaningfully layered"

#~ msgid "只需要简单扩胞 → 用 `Super Cell`"
#~ msgstr "Only periodic replication is needed; use `Super Cell`"

#~ msgid "预设和位移表达式"
#~ msgstr "Preset and displacement expression"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 1。选择内置的变换模板。`1` 是自定义模式，配合下面的 `Dz Expr` "
#~ "写你自己的位移表达式。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `1`. Selects a built-in transformation template. `1` is "
#~ "custom mode and evaluates `Dz Expr`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `sin(x/pi) + sin(y/pi)`。z 方向位移表达式，支持三角函数、指数"
#~ "等数学函数。可用变量：`x`, `y`, `z`, `pi`, `e`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `sin(x/pi) + sin(y/pi)`. z-displacement expression "
#~ "supporting mathematical functions and variables `x`, `y`, `z`, `pi`, and "
#~ "`e`."

